==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Diamond & Pearl|Machop|86}} from the {{TCG|Diamond & Pearl}} expansion.
*'''Shatter''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Unseen Forces|Tyranitar ex|111}} from the {{TCG|EX Unseen Forces}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

